Update the Zigbee firmware to the latest version for products:
- Nortek HUSBZB-1 Zigbee & Z-Wave Plus USB Interface
- CECOMINOD016164 HUSBZB-1 USB Hub
- GoControl Z-Wave/Zigbee QuickStick Combo

It's a self-contained python script and it only uses the standard library.

Firmware binary is from: https://github.com/walthowd/husbzb-firmware